  "rationale": "The plant automata model the robot's motion commands and perception outcomes. The specification automata bind sensor outcomes to safe, progress-oriented actions, enforce conservative obstacle recovery, and ensure full_rotate is used only as a last resort. The design maximizes forward/random_walk exploration, uses short directed turns for obstacle recovery, and only uses move_backward or full_rotate when strictly necessary.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate plant automata for motion and perception to reflect open-loop actuation and asynchronous sensing.",
